WEBVTT

00:14:59.009 --> 00:15:03.637
helikopteret Mi-8 ruse.

00:15:03.637 --> 00:15:07.546
Ulja -- 3:14 dhe 48 sekonda,

00:15:07.546 --> 00:15:09.021
paradite, Central Time.

00:15:09.021 --> 00:15:10.192
CH: Dhe ti shkon tek nje ndalese

00:15:10.192 --> 00:15:11.861
sikur ndonjeri e hodhi anijen tone ne toke

00:15:11.861 --> 00:15:13.243
dhe ajo rrokulliset,

00:15:13.243 --> 00:15:14.249
por ti je gati per kete

00:15:14.249 --> 00:15:15.625
ti je ne nje sedilje te ndertuar per ty,

00:15:15.625 --> 00:15:17.062
ti e di sesi punon absorbuesi.

00:15:17.062 --> 00:15:19.053
Dhe kur me ne fund vijne ruset,

00:15:19.053 --> 00:15:20.211
te nxjerrin jashte,

00:15:20.211 --> 00:15:21.911
te vendosin ne nje karrige,

00:15:21.911 --> 00:15:25.354
dhe tani ti mund te shikosh pas

00:15:25.354 --> 00:15:28.536
tek ajo eksperience e paimagjinueshme.

00:15:28.536 --> 00:15:30.503
Ti ke marre enderrat